283
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,240
Tyrannical.

284
00:12:38,270 --> 00:12:39,120
Lowballers.

285
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:40,600
They treated us like a fucking doormat.

286
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:42,160
Am I supposed
to repay them with flowers?

287
00:12:42,690 --> 00:12:43,960
Only one kind of flower will do the job.

288
00:12:44,210 --> 00:12:45,520
- Stink bell!
- Stink bell!

289
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:47,040
Right on!

290
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:49,060
Did that blast your ears?

291
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:51,880
Natural-looking skin is a must.

292
00:12:51,900 --> 00:12:53,400
I'll give you a nice cut crease.

293
00:12:53,570 --> 00:12:55,320
Today, Mama's male lead
will blow 'em away like...

294
00:12:55,350 --> 00:12:56,680
"Pow! Pow! Pow!"

295
00:12:56,730 --> 00:12:58,110
So cinematic, you go, "Bam, bam, bam!"

296
00:12:58,130 --> 00:12:59,360
From every single angle, okay?

297
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:00,310
Yeah...

298
00:13:00,330 --> 00:13:01,840
Your energy is killing it today.

299
00:13:01,870 --> 00:13:03,180
Abso-freaking-lutely, Mama!

300
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,640
I'm giving it my all

301
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,440
to show those minions

302
00:13:07,090 --> 00:13:09,470
who's boss in this battle.

303
00:13:11,300 --> 00:13:12,000
True that.

304
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:14,300
Those brush-and-hairdryer newbies,

305
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,080
yuck!

306
00:13:15,110 --> 00:13:16,860
If that were me,
I wouldn't hire them, either.

307
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,100
Disgusting!

308
00:13:18,580 --> 00:13:20,420
I feel bad for Renji and Wan, though.

309
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:21,840
With some shabby MUA

310
00:13:22,060 --> 00:13:23,240
doing a sloppy job,

311
00:13:23,570 --> 00:13:25,080
they're not gonna look as sharp

312
00:13:25,110 --> 00:13:26,850
as you two.

313
00:13:26,870 --> 00:13:27,560
Uh...

314
00:13:27,830 --> 00:13:28,880
Susan,

315
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,520
- so...
- What's up?

316
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:32,820
I've heard something,

317
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:34,520
but I don't know if it's true.

318
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:38,280
What is it? Spill.

319
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:42,290
I heard that Wan...

320
00:13:42,310 --> 00:13:44,500
said some bad things about Third.

321
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:46,280
Like, really damaging things.

322
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,100
Whoa...

323
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,320
He said that Third was...

324
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:50,480
a lot to handle

325
00:13:51,020 --> 00:13:52,680
and egotistical.

326
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:53,770
Brutal!

327
00:13:53,790 --> 00:13:55,120
Yes, it's brutal, but...

328
00:13:55,520 --> 00:13:58,240
I think I should find a way
to talk it out with him first.

329
00:13:58,270 --> 00:13:58,880
Ugh...

330
00:13:59,210 --> 00:14:00,740
no need to put this on your plate.

331
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:02,920
When the timing is perfect,

332
00:14:03,070 --> 00:14:04,360
I'll handle it myself,

333
00:14:04,380 --> 00:14:05,100
okay?

334
00:14:05,190 --> 00:14:06,160
Backhanded positivity?

335
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:09,600
Am I done?

336
00:14:09,790 --> 00:14:11,280
Oh... you are.

337
00:14:12,350 --> 00:14:13,360
I'll be back, then.

338
00:14:13,390 --> 00:14:14,340
Where are you going?

339
00:14:17,310 --> 00:14:18,160
I'm annoyed.

340
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:22,480
I'm not in the next scene,

341
00:14:23,470 --> 00:14:24,880
so I'll go get some air.

342
00:14:31,340 --> 00:14:33,300
Alrighty, Wan. Come stand on your mark.

343
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,560
Stand right on your mark.

344
00:14:35,050 --> 00:14:36,960
Okay, Wan is here!

345
00:14:37,050 --> 00:14:38,200
Karn, check the lighting.

346
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:44,560
Don't you think the villain
is wearing too much makeup?

347
00:14:46,870 --> 00:14:48,040
He's trying to steal the show for sure.

348
00:14:49,610 --> 00:14:51,280
Let's tone down his makeup.

349
00:14:54,220 --> 00:14:54,960
Jern.

350
00:14:55,470 --> 00:14:56,180
Jern.

351
00:14:57,300 --> 00:14:58,320
Gotta run something by you.

352
00:14:59,290 --> 00:15:00,480
Yes, what's up?

353
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:03,480
Should we tone down Wan's makeup a bit?

354
00:15:06,190 --> 00:15:08,160
I think he has it on so heavy.

355
00:15:08,430 --> 00:15:09,080
Look,

356
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,140
Nine has such a natural look.

357
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:15,680
Pai, Pai.

358
00:15:15,870 --> 00:15:16,600
What?

359
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:19,310
Wanna tone down Wan's makeup a bit?

360
00:15:19,330 --> 00:15:20,160
She asked.

361
00:15:21,090 --> 00:15:21,960
Good idea.

362
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:24,080
It's a little... too heavy.

363
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:25,780
Okay, okay, okay, alright.

364
00:15:25,950 --> 00:15:26,950
Susan,

365
00:15:28,470 --> 00:15:29,760
give that boy a hand.

366
00:15:29,910 --> 00:15:30,670
Okay, Mama.

367
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:32,360
Let's go.

368
00:15:33,710 --> 00:15:34,800
That look's hard to work with.

369
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:36,980
What are these dolly eyes?

370
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:39,600
Wanna smash everyone
while you steal their thunder?

371
00:15:40,350 --> 00:15:41,180
Next time, try...

372
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,270
less gossiping.

373
00:15:42,290 --> 00:15:43,480
You might be easier to work with.

374
00:15:43,890 --> 00:15:44,600
Just a small tip.

375
00:15:45,260 --> 00:15:46,280
Queen,

376
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:48,280
you're pretty fucking nosy.

377
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:50,520
This is my job.

378
00:15:50,540 --> 00:15:52,450
Next time,
do a good job on the main leads

379
00:15:52,470 --> 00:15:54,080
so you can skip
toning down others' makeup.

380
00:15:54,190 --> 00:15:54,880
Right!

381
00:15:54,990 --> 00:15:56,510
Or maybe a crinkly, old MUA like you

382
00:15:56,530 --> 00:15:57,880
just can't keep up with the trends?

383
00:15:58,960 --> 00:15:59,440
Old?

384
00:16:00,430 --> 00:16:01,640
Your mom is!

385
00:16:03,170 --> 00:16:04,000
What kind of makeup is that?

386
00:16:04,210 --> 00:16:05,380
I thought that was
a frog-hunting headlamp.

387
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,290
I've never taught you

388
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,280
to do dolly eyes like this.

389
00:16:08,870 --> 00:16:11,280
How about you come back
and work for me, carrying my bags?

390
00:16:11,300 --> 00:16:13,360
Doesn't that seem more like your forte?

391
00:16:13,630 --> 00:16:15,120
Jern, are they done?

392
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:16,550
I'm not going back so you guys

393
00:16:16,570 --> 00:16:17,800
can take your inferiority out on us.

394
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:19,360
You tyrannical bunch!

395
00:16:19,590 --> 00:16:20,240
Jern...

396
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:22,440
We once hired you two,

397
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:24,720
so you must do what we say.

398
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:27,160
Don't bite the hands that fed you,

399
00:16:27,270 --> 00:16:27,880
ungrateful bitches!

400
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:29,030
Jern, Jern.

401
00:16:29,050 --> 00:16:30,280
Jern...

402
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:31,920
Jern!

403
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:34,120
Jern!!

404
00:16:35,770 --> 00:16:36,480
Are we all good?

405
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:37,050
We are.

406
00:16:37,070 --> 00:16:37,970
His makeup is good now?

407
00:16:37,990 --> 00:16:39,290
He's nice and toned down.

408
00:16:39,310 --> 00:16:40,500
Okay, if we're all set,

409
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:42,040
please go back to your spot.

410
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,460
Nine, Nine, come on.

411
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,960
Go to your mark.

412
00:16:45,380 --> 00:16:46,380
Okay...

413
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:49,000
Here it is, your mark.

414
00:16:49,110 --> 00:16:50,070
Okay, you remember your lines?

415
00:16:50,090 --> 00:16:50,620
I do.

416
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:51,610
Okay, done with the blocking.

417
00:16:51,630 --> 00:16:52,450
We're good?

418
00:16:52,470 --> 00:16:53,600
Alright, come on.

419
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:56,270
Right, we're ready to roll.

420
00:16:56,290 --> 00:16:57,410
Crew, quiet!

421
00:16:57,430 --> 00:16:59,240
Ready? Let's go. Roll camera!

422
00:16:59,590 --> 00:17:00,520
Camera rolling!

423
00:17:01,180 --> 00:17:01,880
Set!

424
00:17:01,990 --> 00:17:03,480
- Alright, set!
- Set!

425
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:04,680
And...

426
00:17:05,069 --> 00:17:06,480
Action!

427
00:17:14,470 --> 00:17:16,380
You're just an incompetent guy

428
00:17:17,569 --> 00:17:18,880
who dreams of making it to the top.

429
00:17:20,069 --> 00:17:21,839
Why do you have to be so harsh?

430
00:17:22,380 --> 00:17:23,520
Isn't it true?

431
00:17:25,770 --> 00:17:27,579
I'm just working hard on my part.

432
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:29,840
Working hard?

433
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:37,680
Are you working hard,

434
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:39,400
or sleeping your way to the top?

435
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:42,400
Sky...

436
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:45,160
"Truth never dies."

437
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:47,480
But someone might just die...

438
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:49,860
if "the truth" gets told.

439
00:17:59,000 --> 00:17:59,800
Cut!

440
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:00,770
We're through.

441
00:18:00,790 --> 00:18:02,080
Alright, move on to the next scene.

442
00:18:02,100 --> 00:18:04,200
Take Wan to change his hair and makeup.

443
00:18:20,010 --> 00:18:21,040
What the heck are you doing?!

444
00:18:22,700 --> 00:18:23,380
You were good.

445
00:18:25,090 --> 00:18:25,680
Huh?

446
00:18:26,590 --> 00:18:27,640
You did amazing today.

447
00:18:34,190 --> 00:18:35,960
Are you seriously complimenting me?

448
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:38,720
Why?

449
00:18:39,280 --> 00:18:40,280
Do you prefer I cuss you out?

450
00:18:40,750 --> 00:18:41,680
You're getting on my nerves.

451
00:18:44,310 --> 00:18:45,680
We're both done with our schedules today.

452
00:18:46,990 --> 00:18:47,900
Wanna head out with me?

453
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:49,790
Are you nuts?

454
00:18:49,810 --> 00:18:50,880
As if Cher would let me.

455
00:18:51,900 --> 00:18:53,370
Don't you wanna go home early?

456
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:55,400
Just don't forget to tell Cher.

457
00:18:56,030 --> 00:18:57,840
Then, what do I even tell her?

458
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:13,640
You've got it...

459
00:19:13,790 --> 00:19:14,600
Shoot your shot.

460
00:19:54,690 --> 00:19:55,640
Hey, you.

461
00:19:56,210 --> 00:19:57,760
Is it a good idea to sit out here?

462
00:19:58,410 --> 00:19:59,600
I don't think it is.

463
00:20:03,110 --> 00:20:04,720
No one's around here this late.

464
00:20:05,280 --> 00:20:07,360
But what if someone recognizes you?

465
00:20:07,830 --> 00:20:08,760
You're famous!

466
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:09,800
It's fine.

467
00:20:10,100 --> 00:20:10,920
I've been here plenty of times.

468
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:15,900
Hey there, handsome.

469
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:16,840
Back here again?

470
00:20:17,540 --> 00:20:18,920
So now we're shooing customers?

471
00:20:19,070 --> 00:20:20,180
My, my...

472
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:22,120
I see you brought someone with you today.

473
00:20:22,700 --> 00:20:23,960
What would you like to order?

474
00:20:25,590 --> 00:20:26,520
What do you wanna eat?

475
00:20:27,320 --> 00:20:29,130
Wonton noodle soup
with roasted red pork, please.

476
00:20:29,150 --> 00:20:31,360
- Wonton noodle soup, roasted red pork?
- Yes.

477
00:20:31,590 --> 00:20:33,740
And the usual for you, Third?

478
00:20:34,340 --> 00:20:35,680
No chilli flakes, not spicy,

479
00:20:35,770 --> 00:20:37,270
with tons of veggies.

480
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:38,900
Alrighty.

481
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:39,870
Give me a moment.

482
00:20:39,890 --> 00:20:41,000
I'll be right back with it.

483
00:20:44,530 --> 00:20:46,120
This is my No. 1 noodle stall,

484
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:47,600
the best in the entire world.

485
00:20:48,710 --> 00:20:49,640
You like noodles?

486
00:20:50,190 --> 00:20:50,790
Mm.

487
00:20:51,330 --> 00:20:51,960
Mm...

488
00:20:52,190 --> 00:20:52,880
Good.

489
00:20:53,100 --> 00:20:54,200
Then, some other time,

490
00:20:54,220 --> 00:20:57,360
I'll take you to a place
that's the best in the galaxy!

491
00:21:06,180 --> 00:21:07,120
Thank you.

492
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,320
Enjoy your food.

493
00:21:18,780 --> 00:21:20,000
Blow on it first.

494
00:21:20,990 --> 00:21:21,840
Alright, Uncle.

495
00:21:37,130 --> 00:21:38,080
Aren't you gonna season it?

496
00:21:40,010 --> 00:21:41,200
Want me to do it for you?

497
00:21:43,350 --> 00:21:44,260
Mm, go ahead.

498
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:46,470
Let's start with this.

499
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:48,500
Okay.

500
00:21:49,660 --> 00:21:51,200
Sugar...

501
00:21:54,260 --> 00:21:55,040
Alright,

502
00:21:55,380 --> 00:21:56,200
there you go,

503
00:21:57,860 --> 00:21:58,720
noodle soup for babies.

504
00:21:58,740 --> 00:21:59,460
I guarantee you,

505
00:21:59,480 --> 00:22:00,200
it's delicious.

506
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:10,200
What do you think?

507
00:22:11,150 --> 00:22:12,280
Be nice.

508
00:22:12,590 --> 00:22:14,080
Don't forget I have hot soup at hand!

509
00:22:17,500 --> 00:22:18,500
How ruthless.

510
00:22:18,830 --> 00:22:20,000
It's delicious, Chef.

511
00:22:21,510 --> 00:22:22,440
No doubt!

512
00:22:46,780 --> 00:22:47,670
Wan,

513
00:22:47,690 --> 00:22:49,540
do you think...
I should get hair extensions?

514
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:51,160
Third might just like me!

515
00:22:51,430 --> 00:22:52,780
Mm, go ahead and get one.

516
00:22:54,560 --> 00:22:55,600
Can you give me money?

517
00:22:55,990 --> 00:22:56,880
No way.

518
00:22:56,900 --> 00:22:57,960
You have your own savings.

519
00:22:57,990 --> 00:22:59,840
Please, can you?!

520
00:22:59,860 --> 00:23:00,880
No!

521
00:23:01,590 --> 00:23:03,240
Not my head, not my problem.

522
00:23:03,590 --> 00:23:05,640
Maybe having long hair
isn't even his type.

523
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:07,640
Fucking cheap...

524
00:23:10,220 --> 00:23:10,840
Oh?

525
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:12,510
But why are you still here?

526
00:23:12,530 --> 00:23:13,520
Not going on set?

527
00:23:13,870 --> 00:23:15,440
My ride will be here at 5 P.M.

528
00:23:15,600 --> 00:23:16,590
Night calls for night shoots.

529
00:23:16,610 --> 00:23:17,880
Night who?

530
00:23:18,280 --> 00:23:19,120
What's their role?

531
00:23:24,180 --> 00:23:25,140
That's not it...

532
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:26,000
Here's the thing...

533
00:23:26,590 --> 00:23:28,600
Nighttime scenes

534
00:23:28,620 --> 00:23:29,810
are filmed during night shoots,

535
00:23:29,830 --> 00:23:30,800
so they gather

536
00:23:30,950 --> 00:23:32,250
all the nighttime scenes

537
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:33,320
for night shoots.

538
00:23:33,640 --> 00:23:34,310
Oh...

539
00:23:34,330 --> 00:23:36,240
since series aren't filmed
in chronological order.

540
00:23:36,260 --> 00:23:37,040
Mm.

541
00:23:37,230 --> 00:23:39,360
They group the locations into these shoots.

542
00:23:40,070 --> 00:23:41,840
Right, I was gonna compliment you.

543
00:23:41,860 --> 00:23:43,340
You created some nice buzz
from the ceremony.

544
00:23:45,370 --> 00:23:47,040
What? Why the face?

545
00:23:47,610 --> 00:23:48,820
Something happened, huh?

546
00:23:51,080 --> 00:23:51,760
I think...

547
00:23:52,780 --> 00:23:54,080
Nine doesn't like me.

548
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,080
Why would you think so?

549
00:24:01,090 --> 00:24:04,040
Nine entered the dressing room,
not knowing I was there.

550
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:06,280
But do we want Wan to become famous?

551
00:24:06,590 --> 00:24:08,100
- We do, right?
- Exactly.

552
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:08,920
Well... that'd be great.

553
00:24:08,940 --> 00:24:10,360
Scared Wan's gonna become more famous?

554
00:24:10,380 --> 00:24:11,800
How fucking annoying. What do you want?

555
00:24:11,820 --> 00:24:13,860
Be careful, or people
will see your true nature.

556
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:15,210
And Third was saying that...

557
00:24:15,230 --> 00:24:16,560
he'd expose him over something.

558
00:24:17,290 --> 00:24:18,060
Shit...

559
00:24:19,110 --> 00:24:20,580
How are they even partners?

560
00:24:22,980 --> 00:24:23,980
But I wanna know

561
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:25,240
why they're fighting.

562
00:24:25,550 --> 00:24:26,030
Maybe...

563
00:24:26,050 --> 00:24:27,380
they were boyfriends before?

564
00:24:27,730 --> 00:24:28,440
Huh?!

565
00:24:28,730 --> 00:24:30,080
Why so surprised?!

566
00:24:30,400 --> 00:24:31,920
Dude, it's possible,

567
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:33,720
giving their over-the-top chemistry.

568
00:24:34,580 --> 00:24:35,240
I don't think...

569
00:24:35,570 --> 00:24:36,780
that's the case?

570
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:38,720
They're just friends.

